# ---------- 依赖 ----------
**/node_modules/
**/package-lock.json.bak
# monorepo 顶层 lock 必须跟踪;子包旧 lock 由 npm workspaces 协调
packages/**/package-lock.json
dsh-plugin/**/package-lock.json

